        <activityName xml:lang="en">Aluminium melting furnace</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Aluminium melting furnace
Medium sized plant. Output: 10'000 t/a, life time: 50 years. Assumption is based on data for casting plant.;
UUID: dc555e6c-16a3-33ad-a832-05528f0d392d
Production hall and machinery (including disposal). Does not include administrative buildings because they are included in casting plant.
Location: Some Swiss datasets are used for European processes.
Technology: Assumed technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Internet search 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: Uncertainty is adjusted for geographical mismatch (using the pedigree matrix).
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_dc555e6c-16a3-33ad-a832-05528f0d392d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
